{"animath": "0.1", "title": "A-Math kinematics: reading motion from s–t and v–t graphs", "level": "secondary", "subject": "math", "topic": "a-kinematics", "kind": "concept", "canvas": {"width": 960, "height": 540}, "scenes": [{"id": "s1", "caption": "Two graphs, one motion", "duration_ms": 8000, "narration": "A displacement-time graph and a velocity-time graph can describe the same journey. Here the s-t line is straight, so the motion is uniform; the v-t line sits flat, because the speed never changes.", "steps": [{"at_ms": 0, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "line", "x1": 60, "y1": 420, "x2": 420, "y2": 420, "id": "sxa"}}, {"at_ms": 300, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "line", "x1": 90, "y1": 100, "x2": 90, "y2": 450, "id": "sya"}}, {"at_ms": 600, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "line", "x1": 120, "y1": 390, "x2": 390, "y2": 180, "id": "stline"}}, {"at_ms": 900, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "circle", "cx": 120, "cy": 390, "r": 8, "fill": "#d64541", "id": "sdot"}}, {"at_ms": 1400, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "line", "x1": 520, "y1": 420, "x2": 880, "y2": 420, "id": "vxa"}}, {"at_ms": 1700, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "line", "x1": 550, "y1": 100, "x2": 550, "y2": 450, "id": "vya"}}, {"at_ms": 2000, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "line", "x1": 580, "y1": 280, "x2": 850, "y2": 280, "id": "vtline"}}, {"at_ms": 2300, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "circle", "cx": 580, "cy": 280, "r": 8, "fill": "#2b7bb9", "id": "vdot"}}, {"at_ms": 2700, "do": "move", "target": "sdot", "to": {"cx": 255, "cy": 285}, "dur_ms": 1200}, {"at_ms": 2760, "do": "move", "target": "vdot", "to": {"cx": 715, "cy": 280}, "dur_ms": 1140}, {"at_ms": 4200, "do": "move", "target": "sdot", "to": {"cx": 390, "cy": 180}, "dur_ms": 1200}, {"at_ms": 4260, "do": "move", "target": "vdot", "to": {"cx": 850, "cy": 280}, "dur_ms": 1140}, {"at_ms": 5700, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "text", "x": 90, "y": 480, "size": 24, "text": "s–t: straight line ⇒ uniform motion", "id": "lab1"}}, {"at_ms": 6200, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "text", "x": 550, "y": 480, "size": 24, "text": "v–t: flat line ⇒ constant speed", "id": "lab2"}}, {"at_ms": 6800, "do": "caption", "text": "Two graphs, one journey — read each on its own terms"}]}, {"id": "s2", "caption": "Gradient of the s–t graph is the velocity", "duration_ms": 8000, "narration": "Pick two points on the s-t graph and form the gradient triangle: rise in displacement over run in time. That slope is the velocity — rise over run, metres over seconds.", "steps": [{"at_ms": 0, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "line", "x1": 60, "y1": 420, "x2": 420, "y2": 420, "id": "sxa"}}, {"at_ms": 300, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "line", "x1": 90, "y1": 100, "x2": 90, "y2": 450, "id": "sya"}}, {"at_ms": 600, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "line", "x1": 120, "y1": 390, "x2": 390, "y2": 180, "id": "stline"}}, {"at_ms": 1000, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "circle", "cx": 120, "cy": 390, "r": 8, "fill": "#d64541", "id": "probe"}}, {"at_ms": 1300, "do": "move", "target": "probe", "to": {"cx": 255, "cy": 285}, "dur_ms": 1200}, {"at_ms": 2600, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "line", "x1": 255, "y1": 285, "x2": 255, "y2": 285, "id": "run"}}, {"at_ms": 2800, "do": "move", "target": "run", "to": {"x2": 390, "y2": 285}, "dur_ms": 700}, {"at_ms": 3600, "do": "move", "target": "probe", "to": {"cx": 390, "cy": 180}, "dur_ms": 1200}, {"at_ms": 4900, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "line", "x1": 390, "y1": 285, "x2": 390, "y2": 285, "id": "rise"}}, {"at_ms": 5100, "do": "move", "target": "rise", "to": {"x2": 390, "y2": 180}, "dur_ms": 700}, {"at_ms": 5900, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "latex", "x": 480, "y": 130, "size": 40, "tex": "v = \\frac{\\Delta s}{\\Delta t} = \\text{gradient}", "id": "vel"}}, {"at_ms": 6500, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "latex", "x": 480, "y": 230, "size": 38, "tex": "= \\frac{40 - 10}{6 - 0} = 5\\ \\text{m/s}", "id": "num"}}, {"at_ms": 7100, "do": "caption", "text": "Velocity is the slope of the s–t graph"}]}, {"id": "s3", "caption": "Area under the v–t graph is the displacement", "duration_ms": 10000, "narration": "Under the velocity-time curve, each thin rectangle is speed times a small time step — a small distance. Stack them up and the total area is the displacement: displacement is the integral of velocity.", "steps": [{"at_ms": 0, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "line", "x1": 80, "y1": 420, "x2": 880, "y2": 420, "id": "vxa"}}, {"at_ms": 300, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "line", "x1": 120, "y1": 80, "x2": 120, "y2": 470, "id": "vya"}}, {"at_ms": 800, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "line", "x1": 160, "y1": 380, "x2": 340, "y2": 320, "id": "vc1"}}, {"at_ms": 1100, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "line", "x1": 340, "y1": 320, "x2": 520, "y2": 240, "id": "vc2"}}, {"at_ms": 1400, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "line", "x1": 520, "y1": 240, "x2": 700, "y2": 140, "id": "vc3"}}, {"at_ms": 1800, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "circle", "cx": 160, "cy": 380, "r": 8, "fill": "#d64541", "id": "sweep"}}, {"at_ms": 2000, "do": "move", "target": "sweep", "to": {"cx": 340, "cy": 320}, "dur_ms": 800}, {"at_ms": 2900, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "rect", "x": 170, "y": 375, "w": 80, "h": 0, "fill": "#dbe7ff", "stroke": "#2b6cb0", "id": "r1"}}, {"at_ms": 3100, "do": "move", "target": "r1", "to": {"h": 45}, "dur_ms": 600}, {"at_ms": 3800, "do": "move", "target": "sweep", "to": {"cx": 520, "cy": 240}, "dur_ms": 800}, {"at_ms": 4700, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "rect", "x": 280, "y": 345, "w": 80, "h": 0, "fill": "#dbe7ff", "stroke": "#2b6cb0", "id": "r2"}}, {"at_ms": 4900, "do": "move", "target": "r2", "to": {"h": 75}, "dur_ms": 600}, {"at_ms": 5600, "do": "move", "target": "sweep", "to": {"cx": 700, "cy": 140}, "dur_ms": 800}, {"at_ms": 6500, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "rect", "x": 390, "y": 296, "w": 80, "h": 0, "fill": "#dbe7ff", "stroke": "#2b6cb0", "id": "r3"}}, {"at_ms": 6700, "do": "move", "target": "r3", "to": {"h": 124}, "dur_ms": 600}, {"at_ms": 7400, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "rect", "x": 500, "y": 248, "w": 80, "h": 0, "fill": "#dbe7ff", "stroke": "#2b6cb0", "id": "r4"}}, {"at_ms": 7600, "do": "move", "target": "r4", "to": {"h": 172}, "dur_ms": 600}, {"at_ms": 8300, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "rect", "x": 610, "y": 192, "w": 80, "h": 0, "fill": "#dbe7ff", "stroke": "#2b6cb0", "id": "r5"}}, {"at_ms": 8500, "do": "move", "target": "r5", "to": {"h": 228}, "dur_ms": 600}, {"at_ms": 9200, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "latex", "x": 140, "y": 70, "size": 36, "tex": "s = \\text{area under } v\\text{-}t = \\int v\\,dt", "id": "rel"}}, {"at_ms": 9600, "do": "caption", "text": "Displacement is the area stacked under the v–t graph"}]}, {"id": "s4", "caption": "The SUVAT pair — and the gradient trap", "duration_ms": 9000, "narration": "Under acceleration a, velocity is v equals u plus a t, and displacement is u t plus half a t squared. Watch the trap: a straight s-t graph has constant gradient, and s-t gradient is velocity — so acceleration is zero.", "steps": [{"at_ms": 0, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "latex", "x": 120, "y": 110, "size": 50, "tex": "v = u + at", "id": "v"}}, {"at_ms": 1100, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "latex", "x": 120, "y": 210, "size": 50, "tex": "s = ut + \\frac{1}{2}at^2", "id": "s"}}, {"at_ms": 2200, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "line", "x1": 520, "y1": 420, "x2": 880, "y2": 420, "id": "sxa"}}, {"at_ms": 2500, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "line", "x1": 550, "y1": 100, "x2": 550, "y2": 450, "id": "sya"}}, {"at_ms": 2800, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "line", "x1": 580, "y1": 390, "x2": 850, "y2": 250, "id": "stline"}}, {"at_ms": 3200, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "circle", "cx": 580, "cy": 390, "r": 8, "fill": "#d64541", "id": "probe"}}, {"at_ms": 3500, "do": "move", "target": "probe", "to": {"cx": 715, "cy": 320}, "dur_ms": 1100}, {"at_ms": 4700, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "text", "x": 745, "y": 300, "size": 22, "text": "Δs/Δt = const", "id": "glab"}}, {"at_ms": 4900, "do": "move", "target": "probe", "to": {"cx": 850, "cy": 250}, "dur_ms": 1100}, {"at_ms": 4960, "do": "move", "target": "glab", "to": {"x": 780, "y": 225}, "dur_ms": 1040}, {"at_ms": 6100, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "text", "x": 140, "y": 510, "size": 40, "text": "…so the acceleration is constant?", "id": "trap"}}, {"at_ms": 6900, "do": "emphasize", "target": "trap"}, {"at_ms": 7400, "do": "hide", "target": "trap"}, {"at_ms": 7600, "do": "show", "shape": {"kind": "text", "x": 140, "y": 510, "size": 26, "text": "No: constant gradient of s–t means constant velocity — a = 0", "id": "fix"}}, {"at_ms": 8300, "do": "caption", "text": "Read the gradient for the graph in front of you"}]}]}